# Keep project source and editable UEFN content. In particular, do not ignore:
# *.uefnproject, *.uplugin, Config/, Content/*.verse, Content/Python/,
# Content/*.uasset, Content/*.umap, Content/__ExternalActors__/,
# Content/__ExternalObjects__/, docs/, or Resources/.
